    "title": "Leonardo DiCaprio makes rare move with Oscars 2026 date",
    "text": "Leonardo DiCaprio brought his girlfriend, Vittoria Ceretti, as his date to the 2026 Oscars. Though the two did not pose on the red carpet together, they were seated together during the ceremony. The camera panned to the actor, 51, and the model, 27, during host Conan O’Brien’s opening monologue, when O’Brien joked about DiCaprio being “the king of memes.” Leonardo DiCaprio brought his girlfriend, Vittoria Ceretti, to the 2026 Oscars. Kevin Mazur/Getty Images Though they didn’t walk the red carpet together, she was seen sitting beside him during the ceremony, as seen above. ABC When O’Brien asked him to do a meme on the spot of “that feeling when you didn’t agree to this,” DiCaprio was a good sport and made a funny face as Ceretti laughed beside him. DiCaprio is nominated in the Best Actor category for his role in “One Battle After Another.” While rare, this isn’t the first time DiCaprio has brought a girlfriend as his date to the Oscars. He brought supermodel Gisele Bündchen in 2005 and he took Camila Morrone in 2020. Host Conan O’Brien joked that DiCaprio was “the king of memes” during his opening monologue and asked him to do one on the spot of “that feeling when you didn’t agree to this.” ABC DiCaprio, seen walking the red carpet before the show, happily played along as Ceretti laughed beside him. REUTERS DiCaprio is nominated in the Best Actor category for his role in “One Battle After Another.” REUTERS Want more celebrity and pop culture news? Start your day with Page Six Daily. Thanks for signing up! Page Six revealed back in September 2023 that DiCaprio and Ceretti were an item after the duo was caught in a steamy make-out session in an Ibiza nightclub. DiCaprio is famously private about his relationships, though he and Ceretti have been spotted multiple times together. In January, they were photographed on a yacht together partying with Tom Brady. DiCaprio previously brought his then-girlfriend, Gisele Bündchen, to the Oscars in 2005. WireImage He brought Camila Morrone as his date to the Oscars in 2020. ABC via Getty Images He also brought her as his date to Jeff Bezos and Lauren Sanchez’s wedding in June 2025. Meanwhile, in December, they were caught kissing in rare PDA moments while together in Los Angeles. DiCaprio revealed why he prefers to keep a low profile in public earlier that month, “It’s been a balance I’ve been managing my whole adult life and still I’m not an expert,” the actor told Time magazine for a cover interview. “I think my simple philosophy is only get out there and do something when you have something to say, or you have something to show for it,” he continued. “Otherwise, just disappear as much as you possibly can.”",
